    "about": "Auto Finance (formerly Tokemak) runs Autopools, ERC-4626 vaults where users deposit assets such as ETH, USDC or other stablecoins. The vaults allocate and rebalance that liquidity across destinations such as Curve, Balancer, Aave, Morpho and Fluid. Rebalancing and compounding of rewards into the pool's base asset are automated on-chain, and depositors hold an Autopool receipt token. The protocol token TOKE has migrated to AUTO."
